PLACEHOLDER — replace with a real OpenAI API key (sk-…), or delete this file.
Only needed when MULTICA_AGENT_CLI includes `codex`.

Codex authenticates from $CODEX_HOME/auth.json and ignores OPENAI_API_KEY in the
environment, so the entrypoint projects this key into that file at boot with the
CLI's own writer: `codex login --with-api-key`. Alternatively delete this file
and mount an auth.json created by `codex login` (API key or ChatGPT OAuth) at
/run/secrets/codex/auth.json — see auth.json.example.
